    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.11,
      "end_seconds": 162.66,
      "duration_seconds": 5.55,
      "text": "What's your current medication list? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.42,
      "end_seconds": 165.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Cranberry juice, every day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.44,
      "end_seconds": 168.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "I'll check your pressure and pulse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.96,
      "end_seconds": 177.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Rest your hand here..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.87,
      "end_seconds": 205.17,
      "duration_seconds": 8.3,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 126 over 76, heart rate 85, oxygen saturation is 98 percent, temperature is 36.7 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.0,
      "end_seconds": 209.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.0,
      "end_seconds": 213.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "I'll come back to those numbers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.23,
      "end_seconds": 219.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "let's do the the physical part now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.95,
      "end_seconds": 222.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "I'll go gently"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.62,
      "end_seconds": 244.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.48,
      "text": "There's mild tenderness above the pubic bone, and no tenderness in the loins."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.59,
      "end_seconds": 250.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "That's all I need, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.81,
      "end_seconds": 268.07,
      "duration_seconds": 5.26,
      "text": "having listened and examined, the most likely explanation is a urinary tract infection"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 268.86,
      "end_seconds": 274.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "I've been thinking the worst, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.41,
      "end_seconds": 286.16,
      "duration_seconds": 10.75,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a urinary tract infection do well once it's treated properly. Let's get a urine test, for urinary symptoms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 286.76,
      "end_seconds": 289.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "the earliest is Wednesday, 11:30 am"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.42,
      "end_seconds": 313.66,
      "duration_seconds": 22.24,
      "text": "I'm prescribing nitrofurantoin, 100 milligrams, twice a day, for five days. That's for urine infection. Drink plenty of water and don't hold it in when you need to go. I'll want another look if it's not better in three days. Let me check I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 314.62,
      "end_seconds": 326.84,
      "duration_seconds": 12.22,
      "text": "So, I take the nitrofurantoin, 100 milligrams, twice a day and come back if it's not better in three days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.53,
      "end_seconds": 333.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "yes, exactly right okay, I think we're finished is everything clear?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 334.01,
      "end_seconds": 335.97,
